note=" [Q59 (final): ratios re-derived with a 384-variant budget: N H13CN/HCN 0.022+-0.008, S 0.001+-0.010 (<0.031); N H13CO+/HCO+ 0.028+-0.006, S 0.013+-0.006; D(N/S) 3-6 with lower bound 1.2 (95%): suggestive, not decisive.]"
